// Title: Potential Privileged System Service Operation - SeLoadDriverPrivilege
// ID: f63508a0-c809-4435-b3be-ed819394d612
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: xknow (@xknow_infosec), xorxes (@xor_xes)
// Date: 2019-04-08
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
// Description: Detects the usage of the 'SeLoadDriverPrivilege' privilege. This privilege is required to load or unload a device driver.
// With this privilege, the user can dynamically load and unload device drivers or other code in to kernel mode.
// This user right does not apply to Plug and Play device drivers.
// If you exclude privileged users/admins and processes, which are allowed to do so, you are maybe left with bad programs trying to load malicious kernel drivers.
// This will detect Ghost-In-The-Logs (https://github.com/bats3c/Ghost-In-The-Logs) and the usage of Sysinternals and various other tools. So you have to work with a whitelist to find the bad stuff.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((where(EventID = "4673") AND where(PrivilegeList = "SeLoadDriverPrivilege") AND where(Service = "-")) AND NOT ((((where(ProcessName = "C:\\Windows\\explorer.exe") OR where(ProcessName = "C:\\Windows\\HelpPane.exe") OR where(ProcessName = "C:\\Windows\\ImmersiveControlPanel\\SystemSettings.exe") OR where(ProcessName = "C:\\Windows\\System32\\Dism.exe") OR where(ProcessName = "C:\\Windows\\System32\\fltMC.exe") OR where(ProcessName = "C:\\Windows\\System32\\mmc.exe") OR where(ProcessName = "C:\\Windows\\System32\\rundll32.exe") OR where(ProcessName = "C:\\Windows\\System32\\RuntimeBroker.exe") OR where(ProcessName = "C:\\Windows\\System32\\ShellHost.exe") OR where(ProcessName = "C:\\Windows\\System32\\svchost.exe") OR where(ProcessName = "C:\\Windows\\System32\\SystemSettingsBroker.exe") OR where(ProcessName = "C:\\Windows\\System32\\wimserv.exe"))) OR (where(ProcessName ISTARTSWITH "C:\\Program Files\\WindowsApps\\Microsoft")))) AND NOT ((((where(ProcessName ISTARTSWITH "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Dropbox\\") OR where(ProcessName ISTARTSWITH "C:\\Program Files\\Dropbox\\")) AND where(ProcessName IENDSWITH "\\Dropbox.exe")) OR ((where(ProcessName IENDSWITH "\\AppData\\Local\\Microsoft\\Teams\\current\\Teams.exe") OR where(ProcessName IENDSWITH "\\Google\\Chrome\\Application\\chrome.exe") OR where(ProcessName IENDSWITH "\\procexp.exe") OR where(ProcessName IENDSWITH "\\procexp64.exe") OR where(ProcessName IENDSWITH "\\procexp64a.exe") OR where(ProcessName IENDSWITH "\\procmon.exe") OR where(ProcessName IENDSWITH "\\procmon64.exe") OR where(ProcessName IENDSWITH "\\procmon64a.exe"))))))
